L383: ## Appendix C Filtering the Corpus
L384: This section details the procedure used to remove sentences containing direct positive evidence for the target PoS phenomena. Among the five main constructions examined, two (Question Formation and Binding) have identifiable direct positive evidence that could directly support the correct generalization.
L385: Our goal is to construct a conservative filtering procedure that minimizes the risk of leaving potential direct positive evidence in the training corpus, even at the cost of including some false positives.
